body:
Rows/entities returned in _matchingArray() have date fields in correct type in CakePHP v3.1.10 but in v3.2.x not. See example below.

I am using PHP v5.5.11

Example (read the comments):

``` php
// Executed query:

$subquery = $this->pdfDocumentsPubTable
  ->find()
  ->select(['PdfDocumentsPub.id']),
  ->andWhere('PdfDocumentsPub.pdf_place_id = PdfPlaces.id')
  ->orderDesc('PdfDocumentsPub.release_date')
  ->limit(1);

return $this->pdfPlacesTable
  ->find()
  ->matching(
      'LatestPdfDocumentsPub', function ($q) use ($subquery) {
          return $q
              ->where(['LatestPdfDocumentsPub.id' => $subquery]);
      }
  );
```

